   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "05 ANIME HOLD GUIDE (EXPERIMENTAL)\n\nIn-sampler nudge: each step the predicted video is decoded with the tiny taeh3 VAE (madebyollin/taehv, put it in models/vae_approx), held on the 2s/3s the model is already choosing, and the prediction is nudged toward it. width/height/length MUST match the H3 Image-to-Video node.\nHonest result: mild on average (never hurt in our tests, ~10% slower). Anime Cadence after decode does most of the work."
   ]
